      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "Feeling ambitious?  Ribbing is probably the most popular type of cuff for a sock.<br>Even if you don't have a ribber, you can create ribbing.<br><blockquote class=\"smallblock\"><i class=\"fa fa-lightbulb-o fa-2x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\r\nStart your sock with waste yarn and ravel cord. Knit the sock and sew up the seam.\r\n<br>Go back and pick up the live stitches on hand knitting needles and knit your ribbing in the round ... <b> no seam in the ribbing!</b>\r\n\r\n</blockquote>",
              "legacyComponentId": 2880,
              "order": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "video",
              "vimeoId": "151858391",
